@title Controller gamepad: a (fake) pad drives the radio hoist, the dead-man gates it, unplugging stops it
@area Live
@sizes 1366x768
# Lane C5. Under --control the Gamepad section reads a fake pad that the scenario moves with the
# `pad` step (no hardware). Controller card > Gamepad: device, live monitor, "Edit map...",
# "Calibrate...", and the switch that lets the pad drive the controller (off until asked).
open qa/fixtures/radio-hoist.novo
wait 20
key shift+l
wait 20
click_text "Controller…"
wait 20
# The card scrolls: bring the Gamepad section into view.
scroll 1180 500 -700
wait 10
click_text "Gamepad"
wait 20
scroll 1180 500 -100
wait 10
expect "Test gamepad (fake)"
expect "Connected"
expect "This controller has no pad map yet."
shot section-no-map
# A first map for this profile: sticks on the rockers, E-stop and start on buttons.
click_text "Edit map…"
wait 20
expect "Gamepad map"
click_text "Suggest a map"
wait 20
shot map-editor
check_layout
key Escape
wait 10
# Watching only: the pad moves nothing and the section says what it would do.
pad axis left_y 0
wait 5
pad axis left_y 0.9
wait 10
expect "Test, would hold"
expect "Signals (1 of 15 high)"
shot test-would-hold
pad centre
wait 10
# Now let it drive: main on with the start button, then hoist up step 2 with the stick.
click_text "Drive this controller with the pad"
wait 10
pad button start down
wait 5
pad button start up
wait 10
expect "Signals (2 of 15 high)"
pad axis left_y 0.9
wait 10
expect "Holding: hoist"
expect "Signals (4 of 15 high)"
shot pad-hoist-up-2
# Half way: step 1 only.
pad axis left_y 0.3
wait 10
expect "Signals (3 of 15 high)"
# Unplug the pad with the hoist up: everything is let go at once and the radio link drops.
pad axis left_y 0.9
wait 10
pad disconnect
wait 10
expect "Not connected"
expect "Signals (0 of 15 high)"
shot pad-unplugged
# Plug it back in with the stick still over: nothing moves until it has been at rest.
pad connect
wait 10
expect "Signals (1 of 15 high)"
expect "waits until"
shot pad-waits-for-rest
pad centre
wait 10
pad button start down
wait 5
pad button start up
wait 10
pad axis left_y 0.9
wait 10
expect "Signals (4 of 15 high)"
# The E-stop button drops everything.
pad button east down
wait 10
expect "Signals (0 of 15 high)"
shot pad-estop
check_layout
